<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tūrĭfĕr</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">thūr-</span></b> ),
			fĕra, fĕrum, adj.
		tusfero, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>incense-bearing</i>, <i>that
			bears</i>, <i>yields</i>, or <i>produces
				incense</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Indus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					3, 720</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					6, 23, 26, § 104</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sabaei,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 6, 138</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Arabes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. III. Cons. Hon. 71</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">silvae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Rapt. Pros. 2, 81</span></i>
			: grex, <i>that offers frankincense</i>, i. e.
				<i>idolaters</i>, <i>heathen</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Prud. Apoth. 359</span></i>.</div>
